

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H0::
    .string "PROF. BIRCH? Out on fieldwork.\p"
    .string "He went up ROUTE 101 at dawn to\n"
    .string "watch the POOCHYENA feed.\p"
    .string "He said he'd be back by lunch.\n"
    .string "It's well past lunch.\p"
    .string "If you're heading north, would you\n"
    .string "look for him? He'll be the one\l"
    .string "being chased.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H1::
    .string "A sample fridge. The labels read\n"
    .string "GRASS, SOIL, FUR, and one that\l"
    .string "just says LUNCH?$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H2::
    .string "A tracking screen. Most of the\n"
    .string "blinking dots are on ROUTE 101.\p"
    .string "One of them is labelled ME.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H3::
    .string "FIELD ECOLOGY OF HOENN, VOLUME 9.\p"
    .string "Volumes 1 to 8 seem to be out in\n"
    .string "the rain somewhere.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H4::
    .string "WHY POKéMON LIVE WHERE THEY DO,\n"
    .string "by PROF. BIRCH.\p"
    .string "Chapter one is a single word:\n"
    .string "“Outside.”$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H5::
    .string "Field notebooks, row after row.\n"
    .string "Every one has dried out wavy.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H6::
    .string "Books on HOENN's POKéMON, and a\n"
    .string "few from KANTO signed PROF. OAK.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H7::
    .string "Maps of HOENN. The ROUTE 101 sheet\n"
    .string "has been folded until it's soft.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H8::
    .string "Papers on why POKéMON gather where\n"
    .string "they do. Most of the answers say\l"
    .string "“grass.”$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H9::
    .string "Letters from KANTO about the\n"
    .string "NATIONAL POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "“HOENN pages?” is underlined twice\n"
    .string "in the margin.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H10::
    .string "A research PC. A note is stuck to\n"
    .string "the screen: DON'T TOUCH. - AIDE$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H11::
    .string "The PC is sorting sightings by\n"
    .string "route. It will be at this a while.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H12::
    .string "HOENN POKéDEX data. A good many\n"
    .string "entries still read “unknown.”$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H13::
    .string "A report left half-typed. The last\n"
    .string "line says “Back in five minutes.”\p"
    .string "The file was saved three days ago.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H14::
    .string "The PC is playing recorded POKéMON\n"
    .string "cries, very quietly, on a loop.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_H15::
    .string "This PC talks to a NETWORK MACHINE\n"
    .string "far across the sea.\p"
    .string "The screen reads: ONE ISLAND.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_AideBirchIsBack::
    .string "You found him! And he's only a\n"
    .string "little muddy.\p"
    .string "The PROF's waiting at his desk.\n"
    .string "He's been practising what to say.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_AideLater::
    .string "The PROF writes everything down,\n"
    .string "then loses the paper.\p"
    .string "I copy it all into the PC. That's\n"
    .string "most of my job, honestly.\p"
    .string "Bring him your POKéDEX whenever\n"
    .string "you pass. He rates the HOENN side\l"
    .string "every time.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchWelcome::
    .string "There you are! Come in, come in.\n"
    .string "Mind the boxes.\p"
    .string "A CHAMPION saving me from a\n"
    .string "POOCHYENA. I'll never live it down.\p"
    .string "Now. I've been raising a POKéMON\n"
    .string "out in the field, far from the LAB,\l"
    .string "so it would grow up tough.\p"
    .string "I was waiting for the right\n"
    .string "TRAINER to raise it.\p"
    .string "I think that's you.\n"
    .string "Meet TORCHIC!$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchTorchicCelio::
    .string "Oh! You got the TORCHIC I sent\n"
    .string "to CELIO?\p"
    .string "This one hatched from the same\n"
    .string "clutch. They'll be glad of each\l"
    .string "other.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchTorchicNoRoom::
    .string "Party full, BOXES full? For a\n"
    .string "CHAMPION, that's fair enough.\p"
    .string "Make some space. TORCHIC will wait\n"
    .string "right here with me.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchExplainRating::
    .string "It's taken to you already. Good.\p"
    .string "You carry PROF. OAK's NATIONAL\n"
    .string "POKéDEX, don't you?\p"
    .string "I keep the HOENN pages. Show me\n"
    .string "your POKéDEX whenever you visit,\l"
    .string "and I'll rate the HOENN side.\p"
    .string "For every 40 HOENN POKéMON you\n"
    .string "catch, I'll have a reward ready.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRivalHintMay::
    .string "My daughter MAY is out on ROUTE\n"
    .string "103, north of OLDALE, doing survey\l"
    .string "work for me.\p"
    .string "Go and say hello. She'll want a\n"
    .string "battle. She always does.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRivalHintBrendan::
    .string "My son BRENDAN is out on ROUTE\n"
    .string "103, north of OLDALE, doing survey\l"
    .string "work for me.\p"
    .string "Go and say hello. He'll want a\n"
    .string "battle, though he won't say so.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAfterRivalMay::
    .string "MAY told me about your battle.\p"
    .string "She came home, ate standing up,\n"
    .string "and went straight back out to\l"
    .string "train. Thank you, really.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAfterRivalBrendan::
    .string "BRENDAN told me about your battle.\p"
    .string "Well, he said “fine.” Then he\n"
    .string "went straight back out to train.\l"
    .string "That means a lot, from him.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchHintTreecko::
    .string "A field report for you: a TREECKO\n"
    .string "has been guarding the big tree in\l"
    .string "PETALBURG WOODS.\p"
    .string "It won't let anyone near. It might\n"
    .string "make an exception for you.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchHintMudkip::
    .string "And a MUDKIP turned up on the shore\n"
    .string "of ROUTE 104, miles from any swamp.\p"
    .string "Lost, I think. Keep an eye on the\n"
    .string "water by the old cabin.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRatingIntro::
    .string "Let's see your POKéDEX.\n"
    .string "HOENN pages only, please.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRatingCount::
    .string "You've caught {STR_VAR_1} kinds\n"
    .string "of HOENN POKéMON.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating0::
    .string "A start! KANTO's POKéMON you know\n"
    .string "well. HOENN's are a new crowd.\p"
    .string "Try any tall grass. All of it.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating1::
    .string "Now you're looking properly.\p"
    .string "Don't forget the water. Half of\n"
    .string "HOENN is sea.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating2::
    .string "Nearly half! You're doing real\n"
    .string "fieldwork now, whether you meant\l"
    .string "to or not.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating3::
    .string "More than half. My AIDE has had to\n"
    .string "start a whole new file for you.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating4::
    .string "You're closing in. The last few\n"
    .string "are the shy ones. Look where\l"
    .string "nobody looks.\p"
    .string "Don't worry about JIRACHI or\n"
    .string "DEOXYS. I don't count those two.\l"
    .string "Nobody's seen either one twice.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchRating5::
    .string "200… All of HOENN!\p"
    .string "A KANTO CHAMPION's POKéDEX with\n"
    .string "every HOENN page filled in.\p"
    .string "PROF. OAK is going to be terribly\n"
    .string "jealous. I can't wait to tell him.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchReward1::
    .string "For reaching 40: NET BALLS.\n"
    .string "Best on WATER and BUG POKéMON.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchReward2::
    .string "For 80: REPEAT BALLS. They work\n"
    .string "better on kinds you've caught\l"
    .string "before.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchReward3::
    .string "For 120: TIMER BALLS. The longer\n"
    .string "the battle, the better they get.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchReward4::
    .string "For 160: a LUCKY EGG. Whoever\n"
    .string "holds it earns extra EXP. POINTS.\p"
    .string "Give it to one that's behind.\n"
    .string "TORCHIC, perhaps?$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchReward5::
    .string "And for all 200: RARE CANDIES.\p"
    .string "I've been saving these for years.\n"
    .string "I just never knew what for.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchBagFull::
    .string "Your BAG's full. I'll hold on to\n"
    .string "the rest until you have room.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchNextGoal::
    .string "Reach {STR_VAR_2} and come back.\n"
    .string "There'll be something waiting.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchAllRewardsGiven::
    .string "I've nothing left to give you but\n"
    .string "thanks.\p"
    .string "Come by anyway. I like hearing\n"
    .string "what you've seen out there.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BirchBoardingHint::
    .string "Oh, and you'll need somewhere to\n"
    .string "sleep. MRS. WREN, the house across\l"
    .string "from mine, takes in travellers.\p"
    .string "Tell her I sent you. Not that she'd\n"
    .string "turn anyone away.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayLab::
    .string "MAY: I'm writing our battle up for\n"
    .string "Dad. It's taking ages.\p"
    .string "How many Ls in “overwhelming”?\p"
    .string "I'll be out on the roads again\n"
    .string "soon. Farther out, this time!$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_MayLabAllStarters::
    .string "MAY: TORCHIC, TREECKO, and MUDKIP?\n"
    .string "You found all three!\p"
    .string "Dad's been waiting years for\n"
    .string "someone to do that. Show-off.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanLab::
    .string "BRENDAN: Dad wanted a full report.\n"
    .string "I wrote “lost.” He wants more.\p"
    .string "I'm not staying long. There's a lot\n"
    .string "of HOENN I haven't walked yet.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_BrendanLabAllStarters::
    .string "BRENDAN: All three of Dad's\n"
    .string "starters. TREECKO and MUDKIP too.\p"
    .string "…He'll be unbearable for weeks.\n"
    .string "Thanks a lot.$"

LittlerootTown_ProfessorBirchsLab_Text_JohtoReferral::
    .string "ELM's assistant told me about\n"
    .string "your visit to the JOHTO LAB.\p"
    .string "Here in HOENN, I study POKéMON\n"
    .string "in the wild. Welcome to my LAB!$"
@ END PATCH
